      "message": "[Gerrit AI Review]\n`physical_get_protect` is expected to return `1` if the bank is protected and `0` if it is not. Here, if `flash_check_prot_reg` returns `EC_ERROR_ACCESS_DENIED`, this function will return `EC_ERROR_ACCESS_DENIED` (which is `3`). It\u0027s safer to explicitly map this to `1` so the caller correctly interprets the bank as protected.\n\n```c\n\t\tif (ret \u003d\u003d EC_ERROR_ACCESS_DENIED) {\n\t\t\tret \u003d 1;\n\t\t} else {\n\t\t\tret \u003d 0;\n\t\t}\n```",
